title: WDigest Plaintext Credential Caching Enabled
id: b80bfb51-8c77-4bad-9e02-dcf79fb97d49
status: experimental
description: Detects the WDigest UseLogonCredential registry value being set to 1, which forces LSASS to retain cleartext passwords in memory for later credential dumping.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1112/
logsource:
  category: registry_set
  product: windows
detection:
  selection:
    TargetObject|endswith: '\Control\SecurityProviders\WDigest\UseLogonCredential'
    Details: 'DWORD (0x00000001)'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - Image
  - TargetObject
  - Details
falsepositives:
  - Legacy applications or compatibility tooling that intentionally require WDigest
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1112
  - attack.t1003.001
